<title>USA: Actrade completes private placement.</title>
<headline>Actrade completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actrade International Ltd said Monday it closed a private placement of restricted common stock for $6.85 million.</p>
<p>The use of proceeds is intended to facilitate the expansion of its trade acceptance draft program, the company said.</p>
<p>The new equity increases the book value of Actrade by 72 percent, from $8,964,282 to $15,440,732, the company said.</p>
<p>Dilution from the number of new shares issued was 11 percent, from 6,330,681 to 7,015,681, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects revenues from the trade acceptance draft program to increase substantially during fiscal 1998, ending June 30.</p>
</text>
